<span id="A3.T4.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A3.T4.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Bella bought stamps at the post office. Some of the</span></span>
</span></span></span>
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top"></span></span>
<span id="A3.T4.2.1.1.1.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
